1
00:00:00,740 --> 00:00:03,880
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Christina and her son liked to cloud watch.

2
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:05,820
They went outside.

3
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:08,020
They put down a towel.

4
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:10,400
They lay down on it.

5
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:13,280
They looked up at the sky.

6
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:16,320
Christina pointed at a cloud.

7
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:19,920
What do you think that one looks like?

8
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:20,920
She asked.

9
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:23,360
Her son looked at the cloud.

10
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:27,440
It looks like a man chasing a deer,

11
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:28,420
he said.

12
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,340
She was surprised.

13
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:33,580
I think it looks like a girl crying,

14
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:34,420
she said.

15
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:36,300
Her son laughed at her.

16
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:39,300
What do you think that one looks like?

17
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:40,420
He asked.

18
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,520
That one just looks like a regular cloud,

19
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:44,240
she said.

20
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:47,880
I think it looks like you, her son

21
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:48,300
said.

22
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:51,060
She shook her head and laughed.
